    <h1>7. Project Demonstration</h1>
<div class="doc-subtitle">Verification Proofs & Demonstration Guide</div>

<h2>Required Screenshot Placement Table</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>File Name</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>01_User_and_Roles.png</code></td><td>User Administration -> EEE User creation & roles (bb1-bb4) assigned.</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>02_Table_Fields.png</code></td><td>System Definition -> Tables -> u_institution_details schema & choice values.</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>03_Read_ACL_Script.png</code></td><td>System Security -> ACL Read rule with bb1 role, Branch is EEE, and script.</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>04_CRUD_ACLs.png</code></td><td>Create (bb2), Write (bb3), Delete (bb4) ACL definitions list.</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>05_EEE_User_Verification.png</code></td><td>Impersonate EEE User -> Shows ONLY EEE branch records.</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>06_Non_Role_User_Verification.png</code></td><td>Impersonate User without roles -> 0 records displayed.</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>07_Admin_User_Verification.png</code></td><td>Impersonate Admin -> Displays all ECE, EEE, CSE records.</td></tr>
</table>
